= Linux

This file used to describe an older Makefile-based workflow and is no longer the
canonical Linux build guide.

Use the current document instead:

`doc/build-linux.md`

Short version:

```
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build -j
SDL_VIDEODRIVER=x11 EGOBOO_DATA_DIR="$PWD/data" ./build/products/x64/bin/egoboo
```

For refactor work, the repository also now provides a non-UI validator:

```
./build/products/x64/bin/egoboo-content-validator --data-dir "$PWD/data"
```
